# Keep line endings stable across platforms: the plugin ships JS that DSH reads
# directly, and a Windows checkout must not silently rewrite every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch and PowerShell scripts are the exception; Windows tools expect CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
